  title: Hinduism
  text: Hinduism, followed by about four in five Indians, is a family of traditions rooted in the Vedas, the epics and the Puranas, including Vaishnava, Shaiva and Shakta paths and many schools of philosophy. Central ideas include dharma, karma and moksha.
